    await dialog.ShowAsync();
}
```
By using Windows Hello, users can avoid the need to remember complex passwords or use easily guessable ones, which can significantly reduce the risk of password-related security breaches. Additionally, biometric authentication is more secure than traditional password-based authentication because it is much harder to fake or steal someone's biometric data.

